2090 0 obj
  << /ActualText (This project explores how a centralized mobile platform can improve campus event discovery for Penn students through personalized recommendations\054 social interaction\054 and streamlined event management\056 The app combines features such as a personalized FYP\054 Reels\055style event discovery\054 messaging\054 calendar integration\054 and event hosting tools into one cohesive experience\056\n\nWhile the platform includes event hosting functionality\054 the design primarily focuses on the student experience of discovering\054 registering for\054 and managing events\056\n\nThe goal of the project was to reduce the friction students face when trying to discover and keep track of campus events across multiple disconnected platforms\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 2091 0 R
     /Pg 2086 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

