  << /ActualText (To better understand how Penn students currently discover and manage campus events\054 I conducted user research focused on event discovery habits\054 frustrations\054 and feature preferences\056 The survey questions were grouped into three main categories to identify both user pain points and opportunities for design improvement\056)
