2116 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I conducted 3 user interviews to get more information on how students discover events at Penn and any frustration points they face\056 Most students relied on fragmented platforms such as Instagram\054 emails\054 group chats\054 and word of mouth\054 making event discovery overwhelming and difficult to track\056 These interviews revealed key pain points around organization\054 reminders\054 and social discovery\054 which directly informed the design decisions behind PennEvents\056)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 2117 0 R
     /Pg 2086 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
