2134 0 obj
  << /ActualText (In my wireframe prototype\054 I focused on creating a simple and streamlined event registration flow that allowed users to discover\054 filter\054 and sign up for campus events with minimal friction\056 I explored multiple methods of event discovery\054 including browsing through a dedicated short\055form event reels tab and searching through a dedicated events tab with filtering functionality\056\n\nI also focused on exploring how to make event discovery feel more engaging and interactive for students\056 I explored this in a Reels\055style event page and indicators showing how many friends attend\056 Because I had more emphasis on discovery\054 I designed the app around three primary tabs\072 Discover\054 Events\054 and Profile\056)
     /K [ 24 ]
     /P 2135 0 R
     /Pg 2086 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

