2138 0 obj
  << /ActualText (In this version\054 I designed the Discover page\054 which featured short\055form event content\054 to serve as the homepage experience\056 My goal was to create an engaging and immediate way for students to begin exploring campus events as soon as they opened the app\056 I also designed a typical events tab\054 which is how you would normally discover events\054 which is through searching and filtering for events\054 or scrolling through the recommended and popular events\056 I wanted students to use an app that felt familiar to them\056)
     /K [ 26 ]
     /P 2139 0 R
