  << /ActualText (RSVP includes viewing the description page of the event and registering for the event through the button\056 My idea was to have all the important details about the event in the event description page\054 so that students have everything they need in one place\056 This means being able to see who else is attending\n\nI also added the functionality to follow or contact an organization\054 which provides an easy way for students to communicate with organizations\056\n\nWhen students sign up for an event\054 that event will be added to their upcoming events section in the profile page\056)
     /K [ 28 ]
     /P 2143 0 R
     /Pg 2086 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
