2172 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The app begins with a personalized FYP\054 where users can browse recommended events based on their interests\054 search history\054 and previously attended events\056 This helps students discover events more easily across disconnected platforms\056\n\nThe FYP includes three tabs\072 Recommended\054 Friends Going\054 and Reels\056 The Friends Going tab encourages social participation by showing events friends are attending\056 The Reels tab makes event discovery more engaging and familiar to students\056)
     /K [ 43 ]
     /P 2173 0 R
     /Pg 2086 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

