     /S /P
     /Pg 2086 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

2174 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Users can also search for events directly and apply filters to quickly find relevant events\056 \n\nWhile searching for events\054 the app keeps track of recently searched for events and events that are trending\056 I did this to demonstrate recognition over recall and efficiency of use UI\057UX principle\056)
     /K [ 44 ]
     /P 2175 0 R
     /Pg 2086 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
