2190 0 obj
  << /ActualText (With more development time\054 I would further expand the social and organizational aspects of the app\054 particularly features such as shared calendars with friends and more developed tools for hosts and organizations\054 since the current design primarily focuses on the student event discovery experience\056 I would also like to introduce richer app interactions through animations\054 interactive event previews\054 and more dynamic UI elements\056 Additional features such as event analytics for hosts and students\054 engagement insights\054 and campus\055wide leaderboards could further increase interaction and participation within the platform\056)
     /K [ 52 ]
     /P 2191 0 R
     /Pg 2086 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
