2192 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Through this project\054 I learned about the importance of balancing functionality and simplicity when designing mobile applications\056 I\031ve never done UI\057UX design on mobile sized frames\054 and while there are a lot of information that could be included\054 I got to learn and practice how to simplify and condense information onto a smaller frame\056 All in all\054 the process taught me how to prioritize the core user journey and reduce unnecessary complexity within the interface\056 )
     /K [ 53 ]
     /P 2193 0 R
     /Pg 2086 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

2193 0 obj
  << /K [ 2192 0 R ]
     /P 2196 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 2086 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

2194 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Additionally\054 I gained experience designing complete app systems rather than just individual screens\056 Creating flows for event discovery\054 registration\054 messaging\054 notifications\054 and scheduling helped me better understand how different features connect together to create a smoother and more cohesive user experience\056\n\nFinally\054 this project strengthened my skills in prototyping within Figma\054 designing mobile\055first interfaces\054 and creating more cohesive and user\055centered experiences through iterative UI\057UX design\056\n)
     /K [ 54 ]
     /P 2195 0 R
     /Pg 2086 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

